22
00:01:16,910 --> 00:01:19,590
That's called an engineering control.

23
00:01:19,590 --> 00:01:25,210
Literally, you engineer some physical solution to come between people and the hazard.

24
00:01:25,210 --> 00:01:29,070
Like the gloves used to protect infants and NICU incubators when adults interact with them

25
00:01:29,070 --> 00:01:30,070
in their units.

26
00:01:30,070 --> 00:01:31,990
Aw, look how cute.

27
00:01:31,990 --> 00:01:34,350
Okay, where was I?

28
