The aims to change processes, schedules, and other procedures to produce how often, for

32
00:01:47,910 --> 00:01:52,150
how long, and at what level workers are exposed to hazards.

33
00:01:52,150 --> 00:01:56,190
And then there we are again with PPE holding up the whole group as the quote unquote least

34
00:01:56,190 --> 00:01:57,750
effective control method.

35
00:01:57,750 --> 00:02:00,150
I don't want you to get the wrong idea though.

36
